+<details class="s-q"><summary>Do my guests need an app?</summary><div class="s-q-a"><p>No. The page opens in their phone’s browser. iPhone XS and newer read the tag without an app. Android reads it when NFC is on and the screen is unlocked. On Android 17 and newer, a notification appears, and they tap it to open the link.</p></div></details>
+<details class="s-q"><summary>What if their phone doesn’t read the tag?</summary><div class="s-q-a"><p>They scan the QR code next to it and get the same page. iPhone won’t read the tag while the Camera or Wallet app is open, or in Airplane Mode.</p></div></details>
